  [; the repository pages (RULED: DOCS-41, DOCS-49 waves 2–4): one per
     docs-src/repos/<name>.cxd, rendered by `make guide` with every fact
     projected from registry/repos.cxd, registry/modules.cxd and deps.cxd
     (scripts/gen_site/repo_page.cx) and the one example replayed; a line
     here with no source is MISSING, a source with no line is EXTRA, and the
     landing page's repository map links a row's page the day its line is
     here. Wave 2: the front door, the two cores, five platform repositories;
     wave 3: the platform remainder — the wire, mail, the database drivers,
     the fabric, the stream protocol, the keystore, sign-on, the surfaces;
     wave 4, the last eight: the agent surface, the four shipping bindings,
     the package index, the decisions record, the editor and diagram
     surface — every row of the map has its page. A binding and the two
     ecosystem rows nothing is compiled from have no checkout in this tree
     (no deps.cxd row); their pages cite the front door's ABI vectors, the
     application host's store case and a language-corpus case whose notes
     name the ledger page that ruled it, and say so. ]
